2. cross-adapter isolation: `markerVisible(FIRE_FLAME, 'spawned')` true ->
   false ('while a fire is spawned, no other marker is present').
Every other frozen assertion (tap seams, armIn pins, other adapters,
syncMarker) is untouched.

